    "reason": "Three self-host call-resolution paths admitted every enum-variant symbol as a callable target. Payload-free variants still have a name token but no declared payload type, so the resolver synthesized unreachable function calls for them and LLVM retained calls to symbols that were never defined. Module-qualified, imported, and same-namespace sibling resolution now require the exact variant symbol typeNode to be present before treating kind 27 as a constructor call. Retrospective schema normalization of retained historical supervised terminal records and focused8 results; original records retained unchanged in before-schema-recovery files. No claim of current-input acceptance, whole-phase completion, current stability or performance improvement.",
